1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,101
Four robots. Two teams. One unforgiving edge.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,972
Anchor commits. Shade steps aside, turns, and comes back in!

3
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,599
Another charge. Another sidestep. Watch Shade turn into the opening!

4
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:31,680
New bout. Shade draws Anchor forward. Rook cuts around the side.

5
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,990
Blue switches targets! Bolt gets around Shade's exposed side.

6
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:45,815
Rook is running out of room. Shade moves across to cover!

7
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:49,742
Contact at the edge! Anchor loses his footing!

8
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:57,081
And Shade follows him out! One robot lost on each team!

9
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:00,155
Rook finds the side!

10
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:03,599
Time expires. A draw.
